  "description": "If You Are A Long Term Investor, Ignore This Post ❌",
  "body_html": "<p>The VIX on the 4hour has finally broken the <em><strong>local </strong></em>trend with a substantial red candle. It has not broken on the daily or weekly. So if you are a short term trader (a few days) and can manage risk responsibly, continue on. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sJKc!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83f77581-37f4-44f5-abff-c23d6c39ac42_1299x701.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sJKc!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83f77581-37f4-44f5-abff-c23d6c39ac42_1299x701.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sJKc!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83f77581-37f4-44f5-abff-c23d6c39ac42_1299x701.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sJKc!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83f77581-37f4-44f5-abff-c23d6c39ac42_1299x701.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sJKc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83f77581-37f4-44f5-abff-c23d6c39ac42_1299x701.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sJKc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83f77581-37f4-44f5-abff-c23d6c39ac42_1299x701.png\" width=\"1299\" height=\"701\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/